    "我们只选用在条款层面承诺不把 API 数据用于模型训练、并写明保留期限的 AI 服务；服务商条款变化就更换，发布后更换会通知你。Carelogue 自己不留存你的报告文字。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We only use AI services whose terms commit to not training models on API data and state a clear retention period. If those terms change, we switch providers — and once Carelogue is published, we will tell you when we do. Carelogue itself keeps no copy of your report text."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我们只选用在条款层面承诺不把 API 数据用于模型训练、并写明保留期限的 AI 服务；服务商条款变化就更换，发布后更换会通知你。Carelogue 自己不留存你的报告文字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
