    "解释时，Carelogue 会在这台设备上提取报告文字，仅把文字发送给我们选用的 AI 服务用于生成白话说明；照片和 PDF 原件不会离开设备。你可以随时在设置中撤回同意。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When you ask for an explanation, Carelogue extracts the report text on this device and sends only that text to the AI service we use. Photos and PDFs never leave your device. You can withdraw consent at any time in Settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解释时，Carelogue 会在这台设备上提取报告文字，仅把文字发送给我们选用的 AI 服务用于生成白话说明；照片和 PDF 原件不会离开设备。你可以随时在设置中撤回同意。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
